        <UserObject label="064E3B" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;graph TD\n    %% Estilos de Paleta de Colores por Capa\n    classDef presCapa fill:#1e3a8a,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;\n    classDef busCapa fill:#064e3b,stroke:#10b981,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;\n    classDef dataCapa fill:#78350f,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;\n    classDef extCapa fill:#701a75,stroke:#d946ef,stroke-width:2px,color:#ffffff;\n    classDef algoHighlight fill:#831843,stroke:#f43f5e,stroke-width:3px,color:#ffffff;\n\n    subgraph CAPA_PRESENTACION [\&quot;1. CAPA DE PRESENTACIÓN (Frontend)\&quot;]\n        UI1[\&quot;Aplicación Web Responsive&lt;br/&gt;(React / Next.js)\&quot;]:::presCapa\n        UI2[\&quot;Terminales de Enfermería &amp; Tablets\&quot;]:::presCapa\n    end\n\n    subgraph CAPA_LOGICA [\&quot;2. CAPA DE LÓGICA DE NEGOCIO (Backend - FastAPI)\&quot;]\n        GW[\&quot;API Gateway &amp; Reverse Proxy&lt;br/&gt;(NGINX)\&quot;]:::busCapa\n        RBAC[\&quot;Módulo de Identidad &amp; Roles&lt;br/&gt;(RBAC / OAuth2)\&quot;]:::busCapa\n        SURVEY[\&quot;Motor de Encuestas &amp; Pulse Surveys\&quot;]:::busCapa\n        ANON[\&quot;Algoritmo de Anonimización&lt;br/&gt;&amp; Supresión (N &lt; 5)\&quot;]:::algoHighlight\n        ORG[\&quot;Gestor de Organigrama &amp; Plazas&lt;br/&gt;(CAP / PAP)\&quot;]:::busCapa\n        ANALYTICS[\&quot;Motor de Reportes &amp; Analítica\&quot;]:::busCapa\n    end\n\n    subgraph CAPA_DATOS [\&quot;3. CAPA DE DATOS (Persistencia / Storage)\&quot;]\n        OLTP[(\&quot;Base de Datos Transaccional&lt;br/&gt;PostgreSQL (OLTP)\&quot;)]:::dataCapa\n        ETL[\&quot;Proceso de Sincronización&lt;br/&gt;ETL / Batch\&quot;]:::dataCapa\n        OLAP[(\&quot;Datamart Analítico&lt;br/&gt;Clima &amp; Burnout (OLAP)\&quot;)]:::dataCapa\n    end\n\n    subgraph CAPA_EXTERNOS [\&quot;4. CAPA DE SISTEMAS EXTERNOS\&quot;]\n        KEYCLOAK[\&quot;Servidor SSO / IAM&lt;br/&gt;(Keycloak)\&quot;]:::extCapa\n        LEGACY[\&quot;Sistemas Legacy&lt;br/&gt;(SIGA / INFORHUS)\&quot;]:::extCapa\n        MINSA[\&quot;Portal Institucional&lt;br/&gt;(DIRESA / MINSA)\&quot;]:::extCapa\n    end\n\n    %% Flujos y Conexiones\n    UI1 &amp; UI2 ==&gt;|HTTPS / REST API| GW\n    \n    GW --&gt; RBAC\n    GW --&gt; SURVEY\n    GW --&gt; ORG\n    \n    RBAC &lt;--&gt;|Validación Token OAuth2/OIDC| KEYCLOAK\n    SURVEY --&gt; ANON\n    ANON --&gt;|Persistencia Anonimizada| OLTP\n    \n    ORG &lt;--&gt;|Sincronización Lectura CAP/PAP| LEGACY\n    \n    OLTP --&gt;|Ingesta de Datos| ETL\n    ETL --&gt;|Carga Multidimensional| OLAP\n    OLAP --&gt; ANALYTICS\n    ANALYTICS --&gt;|Exportación de Reportes| MINSA&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="RmYn7p-n7nZrxOWLA1AX-33">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
